{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46982","headline":"移居西湖作二首 二 · 齐己","name":"移居西湖作二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官园树影昼阴阴，咫尺清凉莫浣心。\n桃李别教人主掌，烟花不称我追寻。\n蜩[螗]晚噪风枝稳，翡翠闲眠宿处深。\n争似出尘地行止，东林苔径入西林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}